# Canonical author identity for this repository.
#
# Git (`shortlog`, `blame`, `log --use-mailmap`) and GitHub use this file to
# attribute commits that belong to the same person but carry different
# name/email variants. The canonical form matches `authors` in `Cargo.toml`,
# `author` in `package.json`, and the copyright line in `NOTICE`/`LICENSE`.
#
# Format: Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
